Route2_House_Text_FaintedMonsCanUseFieldMoves::
    .string "A fainted POKéMON just has no\n"
    .string "energy left to battle.\p"
    .string "It can still use moves like CUT\n"
    .string "outside of battle.$"


Route2_House_Text_ScientistAsk::
    .string "My research stalled. Field moves\n"
    .string "drain PP faster than I planned.\pTwo ETHERS would let me finish\n"
    .string "the study.$"

Route2_House_Text_ScientistOffer::
    .string "ETHERS! Can I borrow two for my\n"
    .string "experiments?$"

Route2_House_Text_ScientistGives::
    .string "Wonderful! The data is clean.\pAs thanks, take this PP UP. It\n"
    .string "is a tiny contribution to science.$"

Route2_House_Text_ScientistNo::
    .string "Of course. Science can wait.$"
